    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1829-a1">

                <pb facs="1194" n="1078" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1078"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Quiñónez M. to President Wilson.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Great and Good Friend</hi>: By virtue of a leave of
                    absence granted by the Honorable Legislative Assembly to President Carlos
                    Meléndez, I have to-day <pb facs="1195" n="1079" xml:id="pg1079"/> received,
                    before the committee appointed by the said Supreme Body, the Office of Chief
                    Magistrate of the Republic, in my capacity as First Official Designated to
                    receive the Presidency.</p>
                <p>While informing Your Excellency of this event, I take pleasure in assuring you
                    that in discharging the high duties which devolve upon me during the remainder
                    of the presidential term I shall make great endeavor to preserve, as did my
                    predecessor, the cordial relations of friendship existing between the Government
                    of Salvador and that of the United States of America.</p>
                <p>With wishes for Your Excellency’s personal happiness and for the prosperity and
                    greatness of your noble nation, I have the high honor to remain Your Great and
                    good Friend,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alfonso Q</hi></signed>.</closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francisco Martínez S.</hi></p>
                    <closer>
                        <dateline rendition="#float-left">Written in the <placeName><placeName
                                    type="venue">National Palace</placeName>, <placeName type="city"
                                    >San Salvador</placeName></placeName>, <date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-29">August 29,
                            1914</date>.</dateline>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
